<html xmlns:o="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" xmlns:w="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>YES Letterhead</title>
<!--[if gte mso 9]>
<xml>
<w:WordDocument>
<w:View>Print</w:View>
<w:Zoom>100</w:Zoom>
</w:WordDocument>
</xml>
<![endif]-->
<style>
@page Section1 { size: 8.5in 11in; margin: 0.85in 0.9in 0.7in 0.9in; mso-header-margin: .5in; mso-footer-margin: .5in; }
div.Section1 { page: Section1; }
body { font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; color: #2D2A25; font-size: 12pt; }
table.header { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
.crest { width: 84px; }
.school-name { font-family: "Playfair Display", Georgia, serif; font-size: 20pt; font-weight: bold; color: #0B1C3D; line-height: 1.1; }
.tagline { font-family: "Oswald", "Arial Narrow", Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; font-weight: normal; color: #C8202E; letter-spacing: 3pt; text-transform: uppercase; }
.addr { font-family: Consolas, "Courier New", monospace; font-size: 8pt; color: #2D2A25; text-align: right; line-height: 1.6; }
hr.gold { border: none; border-top: 1pt solid #C79226; }
.date { font-family: Consolas, "Courier New", monospace; font-size: 9pt; color: #2D2A25; letter-spacing: 1pt; }
.body { font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; font-size: 13pt; line-height: 1.55; color: #2D2A25; }
.body p { margin: 0 0 12pt 0; }
.body p strong { color: #0B1C3D; }
.sign { font-family: "Brush Script MT", "Lucida Handwriting", cursive; font-size: 24pt; color: #C8202E; }
.sign-name { font-family: "Oswald", "Arial Narrow", Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; color: #0B1C3D; letter-spacing: 2pt; text-transform: uppercase; }
.crimson-bar { width: 100%; height: 8pt; background: #C8202E; }
.gold-bar { width: 100%; height: 5pt; background: #E8B33E; }
.foot { font-family: "Oswald", "Arial Narrow", Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; color: #2D2A25; letter-spacing: 2pt; text-transform: uppercase; border-top: 1pt solid #E8E2D4; padding-top: 8pt; }
.foot .pillars { color: #C8202E; font-weight: bold; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="Section1">

<div class="crimson-bar">&nbsp;</div>
<br>

<table class="header">
<tr>
<td style="width: 100pt; vertical-align: top;">
<img class="crest" src="assets/yes-logo-official.png" alt="YES" width="84">
</td>
<td style="vertical-align: top; padding-left: 14pt;">
<div class="school-name">Youth Empowerment School</div>
<div class="tagline">Faith &nbsp;·&nbsp; Learning &nbsp;·&nbsp; Character &nbsp;·&nbsp; Impact</div>
</td>
<td class="addr" style="vertical-align: top;">
123 Empowerment Way<br>
City, State 00000<br>
+1 (234) 709-0022<br>
youthempowermentschool.live
</td>
</tr>
</table>

<br>
<hr class="gold">
<br>

<p class="date">APRIL 15, 2026</p>

<br>

<div class="body">
<p>Dear Family,</p>
<p>It is with great joy that we welcome you to the Youth Empowerment School community. Your decision to entrust us with your child's education is one we hold with deep gratitude and responsibility.</p>
<p>At YES, we believe every young person carries within them a calling — a unique purpose woven by the Creator. Our mission is to draw that purpose out through Christ-centered teaching, rigorous academics, and the kind of character formation that lasts a lifetime.</p>
<p>We look forward to walking alongside your family in the year ahead. Please don't hesitate to reach out with any questions, prayer requests, or moments of celebration you'd like to share.</p>
<p><strong>Welcome home.</strong></p>
</div>

<br>

<p class="sign">Amara Johnson</p>
<p class="sign-name">Amara Johnson &nbsp;·&nbsp; Head of School</p>

<br><br>

<table class="foot" style="width: 100%;">
<tr>
<td style="width: 30%;">Est. 2024 · Pre-K through 12</td>
<td style="text-align: center; width: 40%;" class="pillars">Faith · Learning · Character · Impact</td>
<td style="text-align: right; width: 30%;">Tuition-Free</td>
</tr>
</table>

<br>
<div class="gold-bar">&nbsp;</div>

</div>
</body>
</html>
